cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "splicescope: detecting and characterizing cryptic splicing from splice junctions"
abstract: >-
  splicescope turns splice junctions and a reference annotation into a junction
  taxonomy, model-free splice-site usage (Psi), differential-splicing tests, and a
  cross-validated classifier that prioritises genuine cryptic-splicing events over
  noise. It ships with a Nextflow pipeline, a Streamlit dashboard, tests and CI.
type: software
